#: ../../api/proteindf_bridge.bond.rst:2 d1c91d059fe447d8ac8d0ba2d1312106
msgid "proteindf\\_bridge.bond module"
msgstr "proteindf\\_bridge.bond モジュール"

#: ../../docstring f0925962e343400785e2a66418e3017a of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:1
msgid "Heuristic bond detector based on covalent radii."
msgstr "共有結合半径に基づくヒューリスティックな結合検出器。"

#: ../../docstring eddf4e513e5b46dfb97c2acb6990c5b6 of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:3
msgid "Bonds are established between pairs of atoms (p, q) satisfying:"
msgstr "次の条件を満たす原子の組 (p, q) の間に結合を形成する:"

#: ../../docstring dd5406867383450b8e79a8bb462aa8ba of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:5
msgid "distance(p, q) <= covalent_radius(p) + covalent_radius(q) + 0.45 Å"
msgstr "distance(p, q) <= covalent_radius(p) + covalent_radius(q) + 0.45 Å"

#: ../../docstring 70a6709179d44c36b5ace6424435d6f8 of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:7
msgid "where 0.45 Å is the covalent bond tolerance."
msgstr "ここで 0.45 Å は共有結合許容誤差。"

#: ../../docstring 7a2ac5ab8b894f8f824288ffcd9f083d of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:9
msgid "Key behaviors:"
msgstr "主な動作:"

#: ../../docstring 729207b3cafe4876bd8df952b970118e of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:10
msgid ""
"No bonds across models: When the structure contains multiple models "
"(satisfying Format.is_models), bonds are not formed between atoms "
"belonging to different models."
msgstr "別モデル間に結合を張らない: 構造が複数モデルを含む場合 (Format.is_models を満たす場合)、異なるモデルに属する原子間には結合を形成しない。"

#: ../../docstring 0bd9e87ff16249f4b824009fc5c36229 of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:13
msgid ""
"Preservation of existing bonds: Pre-existing bonds and their bond orders "
"in the AtomGroup are preserved and not duplicated."
msgstr "既存結合の維持: AtomGroup 内の既存の結合およびその結合次数は保持され、重複登録されない。"

#: ../../docstring 667e12551f004224a789e99f64c32fa7 of
#: proteindf_bridge.rs.Bond:15
msgid ""
"Dense matrix threshold: If the number of atoms exceeds 2000, the pairwise"
" matrices (distmat and bondmat) are None to prevent excessive memory "
"usage, while bond connectivity is still recorded in the AtomGroup in O(N)"
" time."
msgstr "密行列の閾値: 原子数が2000を超える場合、過剰なメモリ消費を防ぐためペアごとの行列 (distmat および bondmat) は None となるが、結合の接続情報は O(N) の計算量で AtomGroup に記録される。"

#: ../../docstring 63098924fb4a457cba2059aff7bde03f of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.bondmat:1
msgid "Pairwise bond connectivity matrix, or None if atom count exceeds 2000."
msgstr "原子対の結合接続行列。原子数が2000を超える場合は None。"

#: ../../docstring 4313ff2bee984e09bba07ad720087992 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.bondmat:3
msgid ""
"Returns a SymmetricMatrix (1.0 for bonded, 0.0 otherwise) when the number"
" of atoms is 2000 or fewer, or None if there are more than 2000 atoms to "
"protect against O(N^2) memory consumption."
msgstr "原子数が2000以下の場合は SymmetricMatrix (結合ありは 1.0、なしは 0.0) を返し、2000原子を超える場合は O(N^2) のメモリ消費を防ぐため None を返す。"

#: ../../docstring 89c4ffc9d0314577a745d47e3b178ef3 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.distmat:1
msgid "Pairwise atomic distance matrix, or None if atom count exceeds 2000."
msgstr "原子対の距離行列。原子数が2000を超える場合は None。"

#: ../../docstring 162e5415e3a34067bfda68d2b6b01de1 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.distmat:3
msgid ""
"Returns a SymmetricMatrix when the number of atoms is 2000 or fewer, or "
"None if there are more than 2000 atoms to protect against O(N^2) memory "
"consumption."
msgstr "原子数が2000以下の場合は SymmetricMatrix を返し、2000原子を超える場合は O(N^2) のメモリ消費を防ぐため None を返す。"

#: ../../docstring cf55ffd877504722bfc1cdf1c5f0d65f of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.setup:1
msgid "Detects and sets up covalent bonds for the given molecular structure."
msgstr "指定された分子構造の共有結合を検出し設定する。"

#: ../../docstring 4dc0fa0aace64a6ab81c505873effccd of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.setup:3
msgid ""
"Computes interatomic distances and adds detected covalent bonds to `mol`."
" Existing bonds and their bond orders are preserved without duplicate "
"registration. If `mol` represents multiple models, no bonds are formed "
"across different models."
msgstr "原子間距離を計算し、検出された共有結合を `mol` に追加する。既存の結合とその結合次数は重複登録されることなく保持される。`mol` が複数モデルを表す場合、別モデル間に結合は形成されない。"

#: ../../api/proteindf_bridge.bond.rst 42b4055cf60149f5a94df91ae3e17e03
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../docstring e42e113c737e43f8a99691e70d019851 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.setup:8
msgid "Molecular structure to analyze and update."
msgstr "解析および更新対象の分子構造。"

#: ../../api/proteindf_bridge.bond.rst 8bac1f3a3fcd4dc6a84eb538895857a3
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: ../../docstring 410144b4dd1446c3bc80c1bed23d2e85 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.setup:11
msgid "None"
msgstr "None"

#: ../../api/proteindf_bridge.bond.rst 32493d398d434e7bb5c96f8ea6b7ee60
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "例外"

#: ../../docstring 591355b8353d4d0cb9588219ac229538 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.setup:13
msgid "If `mol` is not an AtomGroup instance."
msgstr "`mol` が AtomGroup インスタンスでない場合。"

#: ../../docstring 47519820d1bf4dcab2aa8bf41fb9b133 of
#: proteindf_bridge.bond.Bond.setup:14
msgid "If calculating covalent radii fails (e.g., unknown element)."
msgstr "共有結合半径の計算に失敗した場合 (例: 未知の元素)。"

